<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρο-λογέομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρολόγος</span>, esp. <i>examine
				minutely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				429
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.1.26
			</span></i>; <i>split hairs</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μικρολογησόμενος οὐδὲ περὶ τῶν
					ὀνομάτων μαχούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					33.3
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρολογούμενοι παθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Pun.</u>
					79
				</span></i>
			:—later in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <i>use trivial language</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				56
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>deal meanly</i> or <i>shabbily</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὺς θεούς</span> (in sacrifice) <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nav.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τοὺς θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.179f
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὺς φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					7p.429M.
				</span></i>
			</div>
